@startuml
title Drop Command Sequence Diagram

participant User
participant WebproxyServer
participant Database

User ->> WebproxyServer: /su-drop users example_user
WebproxyServer ->> Database: drop_users_by_display_name("example_user")
Database --> WebproxyServer: count (1)
WebproxyServer ->> User: "Dropped 1 user(s) with display name example_user"

User ->> WebproxyServer: /su-drop clusters cluster_id
WebproxyServer ->> Database: drop_by_id("clusters", "cluster_id", "cluster", "cluster_id")
Database --> WebproxyServer: "Dropped cluster cluster_id"

User ->> WebproxyServer: /su-drop pending_resources resource_id
WebproxyServer ->> Database: drop_by_id("pending_resources", "resource_id", "pending resource", "resource_id")
Database --> WebproxyServer: "Dropped pending resource resource_id"
@enduml
